[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_3]
Never Too Many

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_3_desc]
It is well known that if you want more ponies in the army, you don’t need to give them names, or even a number. Just copy and paste, then recolor them.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_3]
从不嫌多

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_3_desc]
众所周知，想要军队里有更多的小马，不需要给他们起名，甚至不需要一个编号，只需要复制一下，然后重新上色就可以了。

